---
title: Caramel Frosting
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Frostings
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@butter{6%Tbsp}
@milk{1/3%c}
@brown sugar{1/2%c}
@powdered sugar{1.5%c}
@salt{1%pinch}
@vanilla{1/2%tsp}

Melt together butter, milk, and brown sugar and boil for 2 minutes. Chill.
Add powdered sugar, salt, and vanilla to chilled mixture. Beat well.
